window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>No Fear. No Pause. No End.</i></p> <p>Everything Cade Donovan did was to keep his family safe. The next steps that he must take will ensure their future. Love isn’t on his agenda, there’s too much darkness inside of him to entertain the thought. Then she came into his life, or had she always been there?</p> <p><i>Stand her ground.</i></p> <p>Shawna Allen has fought long and hard for the life she has now, so giving it up is not an option—not for her ex or her controlling uncle. What happens from this point on is exactly what needs to happen to maintain her hard-won control. Except Cade Donovan isn’t a man to be tamed. But could he be the man she’s meant to love?</p>"; 
